const description = 'How a Caversham estate agent achieved Google Maps dominance for property searches across Reading, Tilehurst, and Earley. Local SEO case study.';

const faqItems = [
  {
    q: 'Can estate agents compete with Rightmove and Zoopla in organic search?',
    a: 'Not for generic national terms, nor should they attempt to. The opportunity for independent estate agents lies in local search: Google Maps, the local pack, and location-specific queries such as "estate agents caversham" or "houses for sale tilehurst". Rightmove dominates organic listings but cannot appear within the local pack. That is where independents prevail.'
  },
  {
    q: 'How significant are Google reviews for estate agents?',
    a: 'Google reviews represent one of the strongest ranking signals for local pack visibility. Estate agents with greater review volume, higher average ratings, and recent review activity consistently outrank competitors with fewer or older reviews. Beyond rankings, reviews also influence click-through rates. Prospective buyers and sellers examine reviews before selecting an agent.'
  },
  {
    q: 'What is the typical timeline for ranking in the local pack for property searches?',
    a: 'Local pack improvements can emerge within 4 to 8 weeks of optimising Google Business Profile, building citations, and generating reviews. Full multi-area dominance across Reading, Caversham, Tilehurst, and surrounding areas typically requires 4 to 6 months of sustained local SEO work. The timeline is contingent upon the strength of existing competitors and the starting state of your online presence.'
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you develop area guide content for estate agents?',
    a: 'Yes. Area guides are among the most effective content strategies for estate agents. They target location-specific searches, demonstrate genuine local expertise, and provide natural internal linking opportunities. We develop area guides for every neighbourhood and suburb you serve, each written with authentic local knowledge rather than generic property descriptions.'
  }
];

