        <h2>Get Your Estate Agency's SEO Audit</h2>
        <p class="text-white/90 mb-4">Discover where your Reading estate agency stands in Google Maps, organic search, and AI search engines. We will identify the local SEO opportunities specific to your areas and property types.</p>
        <a href="/free-seo-audit-reading/">Book a Consultation</a>
      </div>

